From e3b3041bd0d80e3da9a59a481d0486526fb3a2bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 09:07:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Switch Recently Added to a Tabler timeline view

Replaces the list-group rows with Tabler's timeline component
(https://docs.tabler.io/ui/components/timeline): each recently-created
block is a timeline-event with its type-colored icon as the marker and a
nested timeline-event-card showing the site address, creation date,
block type, and Disabled badge where relevant -- same information as
before, in Tabler's native timeline layout instead of a plain list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GdhKf193j6ggwAGFYCUaJg
